# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
tmp/
scratch/
latex_cbm/
.codex-remote-attachments/
reports/*.pdf
reports/*.md
reports/*.txt
!reports/Cover_Letter.md
!reports/Highlights.md
!reports/Highlights.txt
!reports/Submission_Package_Checklist.md
!reports/manuscript_IEEEtran_submission.pdf
!reports/manuscript_submission.pdf
reports/archive/
reports/figures/
*.bak
